      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\ndef stop_day(p_values, threshold):\n    for i, p in enumerate(p_values):\n        if p < threshold:\n            return i + 1\n    return 0\n\n\nprint(stop_day([0.3, 0.2, 0.004, 0.001], 0.0074))\nprint(stop_day([0.3, 0.2, 0.1], 0.0074))\n```"
